Protocol discipline:

- Shared protocol definitions live in `protocol/`; do not fork divergent copies.
- Version source is `protocol/showduino_protocol_version.h` and related shared headers.
- Do not invent undocumented parallel message formats.
- Any protocol change must inspect and update all affected senders/receivers.

Protocol change checklist:
1. Locate all senders.
2. Locate all receivers.
3. Inspect compatibility impact.
4. Update shared definitions.
5. Update parsers.
6. Update serializers/emitters.
7. Update protocol version where required.
8. Update docs.
9. Compile affected firmware targets.
10. Run relevant protocol/host tests.
11. Explicitly report compatibility impact.
